{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Segre嵌入"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Segre 嵌入"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $E_1,\\cdots,E_n$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"向量丛","text":"向量丛"}},{"Plain":",\n记 $P = P(E_1) \\times_X\\cdots\\times_X P(E_n)$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"射影丛","text":"射影丛"}},{"Plain":"的纤维积, 考虑 $P$ 上的线丛\n$$\r\nL = \\mathrm{pr}_1^* \\mathcal O(1)\\otimes\\cdots\\otimes\\mathrm{pr}_n^*\\mathcal O(1),\r\n$$\n带上\n$$\r\n(P\\to X)^* (E_1\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X}\\cdots\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X} E_n) \\twoheadrightarrow L\r\n$$\n对应的映射 (见"},{"Local":{"url":"相对射影谱","text":"相对射影谱"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\nP(E_1) \\times_X\\cdots\\times_X P(E_n) \\to P(E_1\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X}\\cdots\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X} E_n).\r\n$$\n称为<strong>Segre 嵌入</strong>. 它是一个闭嵌入.</p>\n"}]}}